#X obj 400 320 oscformat cutit param;
#X obj 400 350 list prepend send;
#X obj 400 380 list trim;
#X text 30 320 heartbeat every 500ms. It is what the phone uses to
detect a dead link \, so it must keep flowing even when nothing else
is happening.;
#X text 400 420 All four knobs send NAME + VALUE to one address. The
name is the parameter \, not the control \, so the display says what
was changed rather than which knob moved.;
#X text 30 420 State \, never events: every message carries the whole
current value \, so a dropped packet self-corrects on the next send.;
#X text 300 120 iPhone IP and PdParty receive port;
